# Project 08 - Oracle Enterprise SQL Assistant (POC)

## Project Objective

The goal of this project is to extend the Production SQL Assistant developed in Project 07 to work with a real Oracle enterprise database.

Instead of querying a local SQLite database, the assistant now connects to a live Oracle database, dynamically discovers the schema, generates Oracle-compatible SQL, executes it safely, and converts the results into natural language.

This project serves as a Proof of Concept (POC) for integrating LLM-powered SQL Assistants with enterprise databases.

